WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Maria Chen: We're still short on welders on the floor, and that's pushing a lot of overtime onto the people we do have.

2
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:15.000
Maria Chen: And the overtime is what's driving people to quit -- we've lost three welders this quarter alone to burnout.

3
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:20.500
David Okafor: We're seeing the same thing. Higher turnover means we're training new hires constantly, which is its own drag on productivity.

4
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
David Okafor: If tariffs on imported steel go up, our input costs will follow -- but that hasn't happened yet.

5
00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:33.500
Maria Chen: Automation on the line has not reduced our headcount need at all, for what it's worth.

6
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:41.000
David Okafor: Someone at another shop told me their on-time delivery rate improved a lot after they fixed their scheduling software.
